56:27.429 --> 56:30.597
- [vocalizing]

56:30.598 --> 56:33.559
- [screaming]

56:33.560 --> 56:36.604
Now that's wicked.

56:38.023 --> 56:39.481
[cheers and applause]

56:39.482 --> 56:42.694
<i>- Please welcome Bowen Yang.</i>

56:45.488 --> 56:46.947
