57:00.628 --> 57:02.880
I didn't get the part
because Jon M. Chu said

57:02.881 --> 57:06.468
that I was
"too conventionally attractive"

57:06.593 --> 57:09.720
and that "rejection would
make me a better Pfannee."

57:09.721 --> 57:10.888
That's the name
of my character.

57:10.889 --> 57:13.849
Did you know that?
Most people don't.

57:13.850 --> 57:15.893
But he was nice enough
to let me be

57:15.894 --> 57:19.688
Fiyero's understudy,
which many have told me

57:19.689 --> 57:23.525
