57:50.345 --> 57:53.055
♪ Believe me, I've been
kicked out of enough of them ♪

57:53.056 --> 57:56.433
♪ To know ♪

57:56.434 --> 57:58.852
♪ They want you to become
less callow ♪

57:58.853 --> 58:00.979
♪ Less shallow ♪
Guys.

58:00.980 --> 58:05.609
♪ But I say,
why invite stress in? ♪

58:05.610 --> 58:07.778
♪ ♪

58:07.779 --> 58:11.074
♪ Stop studying strife ♪

58:11.199 --> 58:13.451
♪ And learn to live ♪

58:13.576 --> 58:16.579
