58:16.705 --> 58:20.874
♪ Life ♪

58:20.875 --> 58:24.753
♪ ♪

58:24.754 --> 58:26.589
♪ Dancing through life ♪

58:26.715 --> 58:28.842
♪ Skimming the surface ♪

58:28.967 --> 58:32.804
♪ Gliding where turf
