58:34.889 --> 58:36.849
♪ For the brainless ♪

58:36.850 --> 58:40.478
♪ Why think too hard
when it's so soothing ♪

58:40.603 --> 58:42.396
♪ Dancing through life? ♪

58:42.397 --> 58:44.356
♪ No need to tough it ♪

58:44.357 --> 58:48.736
♪ When you can
