58:48.737 --> 58:52.740
♪ Nothing matters,
but knowing nothing matters ♪

58:52.741 --> 58:54.701
♪ It's just life ♪

58:54.826 --> 58:57.912
♪ So keep dancing through ♪

58:58.038 --> 58:59.414
- Hey, Bowen.

58:59.539 --> 59:01.665
- Ethan, what the Boq
are you doing?

59:01.666 --> 59:03.752
- Nice job working my character
name into the segment.

59:03.877 --> 59:05.961
But tonight,
I'm Fiyero's understudy.

59:05.962 --> 59:07.964
- No, I'm Fiyero's understudy.

59:08.089 --> 59:10.841
- According to who?
- According to Chu, Jon M. Chu.

59:10.842 --> 59:12.259
Hey, what does the M stand for?

59:12.260 --> 59:14.596
- I think movies.
- Yeah, movies.

59:14.721 --> 59:16.388
Get those Fiyero duds
off of you right now.

59:16.389 --> 59:17.473
- Wait.
Hold on, Bowen.

59:17.474 --> 59:19.516
I think I hear
our cue coming up.

59:19.517 --> 59:21.477
both: * Dancing through life ♪

59:21.478 --> 59:23.354
♪ Swaying and sweeping ♪

59:23.355 --> 59:27.775
- ♪ And always keeping cool ♪

59:27.776 --> 59:31.321
- ♪ Life is fraughtless
when you're thoughtless ♪

59:31.446 --> 59:35.032
- ♪ Those who don't try
never look foolish ♪

59:35.033 --> 59:36.868
♪ Dancing through life ♪

59:36.993 --> 59:38.952
♪ Mindless and careless ♪

59:38.953 --> 59:42.498
♪ Make sure you're where
less trouble is rife ♪

59:42.499 --> 59:44.375
♪ Woes are fleeting ♪

59:44.376 --> 59:47.127
♪ Blows are glancing ♪

59:47.128 --> 59:49.713
♪ When you're dancing ♪

59:49.714 --> 59:53.509
♪ Through life ♪

59:53.510 --> 59:54.551
Whoo!

59:54.552 --> 01:00:00.599
♪ ♪

01:00:00.600 --> 01:00:02.059
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

01:00:02.060 --> 01:00:04.062
- That was cool.
That was really good.

01:00:04.187 --> 01:00:05.396
Let's go. Come on.

01:00:05.397 --> 01:00:12.445
